kotlin-syntax
Copyright 2026 Vladimir Krivosheev

This product is a Rust port of the Kotlin compiler's lexer and parser:
compiler/psi/parser/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/lexer/Kotlin.flex and
compiler/psi/parser/src/org/jetbrains/kotlin/parsing/*.java of
https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin at commit 9180ce6a7a7d3627f88b424717583f28ddca052d (Kotlin 2.4.21),
and of the parts of IntelliJ Platform's PsiBuilderImpl the Kotlin parser relies on
(https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community, platform/core-impl/src/com/intellij/lang/impl/PsiBuilderImpl.java).

